==Battleground==
*2 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 8~9.33 seconds<sup>240f~280f</sup>.
*7 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Fallen Bear]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*2 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 5.33~8 seconds<sup>160f~240f</sup>.
*25 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 12~13.33 seconds<sup>360f~400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Wicked Face]] spawns as the boss.
**8 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn, delay 2~3.33 seconds<sup>60f~100f</sup>.
**7 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn, delay 3.33~4 seconds<sup>100f~120f</sup>.
**1 [[Fallen Bear]] spawns.
**Infinite [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn, delay 6.67~8.67 seconds<sup>200f~260f</sup>.

==Strategy==
You can treat this stage as an easier version of the [[Hawaii (Aku Realm)|Hawaii/Okinawa]] stage from [[The Aku Realms]]. [[Sinner Snache]] and [[Condemned Peng]] are absent, meaning significantly less [[Surge Attack]]s. [[Aku Gory]], a massive damage dealer, is also absent. Bring [[:Category:Anti-Aku Cats|anti-Aku units]], [[:Category:Shield Piercing Cats|Shield Piercing units]], and [[:Category:Cats with Wave Immunity|Wave Shields]] for an easy battle.

